OL,3,CFire crews battle large wildfire on
OL,4,Ccliff edge
OL,6,FDrone footage of the wildfire. Video
OL,7,Fcredit: Droneman, Cornwall
OL,9,FEmergency fire crews have been
OL,10,Ffighting a large wildfire on a cliff
OL,11,Fedge in Cornwall.
OL,13,FThe gorse fire on North Cliffs near
OL,14,FPortreath has been burning overnight,
OL,15,Fwith firefighters using hose reels and
OL,16,Fbeaters to extinguish it.
OL,18,FCrews have been battling the blaze
OL,19,Fsince yesterday afternoon, Monday 3
OL,20,FAugust.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/2
