OL,3,CFire crews battle large wildfire on
OL,4,Ccliff edge
OL,6,FHuge plumes of smoke could be seen
OL,7,Ffrom across the bay.
OL,9,FCornwall Fire and Rescue Service
OL,10,Fposted its latest update in the early
OL,11,Fhours of this morning, Tuesday 4
OL,12,FAugust, to say the incident is ongoing.
